+/*
+ * BDB version number dependencies are documented as:
+ *
+ * <start>+
+ *    indicates the field was introduced in version <start>
+ *    and is still valid
+ *
+ * <start>-<end>
+ *    indicates the field was introduced in version <start>
+ *    and obsoleted in version <end>+1.
+ *
+ * ??? indicates the specific version number is unknown
+ */
+
